# Selection date: 2026-11-06. All releases are at least 14 days old.
# H2 후 확정. Includes PR #416 (since v0.27.0); PC4 does not replace load testing.
# Released 2026-10-20: https://github.com/lablup/all-smi/releases/tag/v0.28.1
ALLSMI_VERSION=0.28.1
# Released 2026-10-21: latest eligible non-prerelease collector distribution.
# https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-releases/releases/tag/v0.163.2
OTELCOL_VERSION=0.163.2
# Released 2026-08-24: v59.1 is too recent; use v58.2 for both TP and UI.
# https://github.com/google/perfetto/releases/tag/v58.2
PERFETTO_VERSION=58.2
# perfetto 0.59.1 (2026-10-26) fails the 14-day rule; match v58.2 instead.
# Verified imports: TraceProtoBuilder and TraceProcessorConfig(bin_path=...).
# matplotlib 3.10.9 is the last 3.10 series release supporting Python 3.10.
# Dependencies below are pinned for CPython 3.10-3.13, Linux x86_64.
# Released 2026-08-24: https://pypi.org/project/perfetto/0.58.2/
